<title>USA: Cadbury names Stitzer Pepper CEO-WSJ.</title>
<headline>Cadbury names Stitzer Pepper CEO-WSJ.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cadbury Schweppes plc named Todd Stitzer, chief operating officer of Cadbury Beverages/Seven Up, as president and chief executive of its Dr Pepper/Seven Up unit, the Wall Street Journal said in Monday's electronic edition.</p>
<p>Stitzer would act as the North America-based beverage head for the British beverage and candy company, the paper said.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
